Licensing for raetha/zepp-watch-faces
=====================================

This repository uses different licences for different parts. In short: the
shared tooling is free to reuse for anything, while each watch face's design
may be shared and remixed but not sold by anyone other than the author.

1. Shared code and tooling: MIT (see LICENSES/MIT.txt)
   - lib/            (shared watch-face runtime and generator helpers)
   - tools/          (asset pipeline, test harness, previews, build/site scripts)
   - .github/        (CI configuration)
   - repository-level docs and config files (README.md, docs/, package.json, ...)

2. Each watch face: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt)
   Everything inside faces/<name>/ - its artwork, generated images, layout,
   design parameters, code, screenshots and documentation - is licensed under
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International.
   You may study, share and adapt a face for non-commercial purposes, with
   credit, under the same licence. You may not sell a face or a derivative of it.
   Build your own face (your own artwork and design) with the MIT tooling if you
   want to sell it.

3. Names and logos are not licensed
   Watch-face names (for example "Sextant") and any logos or icons used to
   identify them in stores are not licensed for reuse under either licence.
   Derivatives must use a different name.

4. Fonts: SIL Open Font License 1.1
   fonts/ and the subset fonts inside each face's assets are Roboto Condensed,
   licensed under the OFL (fonts/OFL-RobotoCondensed.txt). The OFL permits
   bundling it in paid apps.

The author (raetha) holds the copyright in all original material and may
distribute any face under other terms, including in paid app stores.

Copyright (c) 2026 raetha
